@TsafrirA I changed this to use something similar to your example circuit in #3214  and set of observables + got rid of StateVector simulation (It does not support projectors).

WDYT, could we use this PR as a base and treat your work on top of this to foxus on getting more precise assertions on the EV distributions?

Edit: I needed to remove ZXY, as it was always Zero and not affected by noise, causing assertions around mitigations to fail.
